{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "07A9", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-spectral-sequence-ext}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e6e3e2f6d639a3069e3a614f4f200b8d7dbe2f5de8a305eef2ff9d2854be6de3", "source_text": "Spectral sequences for Ext", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1d534d11d76a1fed51a4662b101e46a417b094584a2d4b959a92dbaa43431c43", "unit_id": "tag:07A9:title"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07A9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{F}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\Ext^n_\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{F}^\\bullet)\n=\n\\Hom_{D(\\mathcal{O})}(\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{F}^\\bullet[n])\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{derived-section-ext}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6bafe0e77746eab05d3eb2980d7d085c3565719f541b79617271e02412aaf7a8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e16efe7579ea93ae3a3147885adec098e9de6156313b1046efd58b543250c866", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we collect various spectral sequences that come up\nwhen considering the Ext functors. For any pair of complexes\n<MATH_0001> of complexes of modules\non a ringed site <MATH_0002> we denote\n<MATH_0003>\naccording to our general conventions in\nDerived Categories, Section <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4a724e3991d9b4d6361e909626a6773619006662c48037bca999ae09ff6fd53a", "unit_id": "tag:07A9:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "07A9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0006": "$E_2$", "MATH_0007": "$$\nE_2^{i, j} =\n\\Ext_\\mathcal{O}^i(H^{-j}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet), \\mathcal{F})\n\\Rightarrow\n\\Ext_\\mathcal{O}^{i + j}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{F})\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$E_1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nE_1^{i, j} =\n\\Ext_\\mathcal{O}^j(\\mathcal{K}^{-i}, \\mathcal{F})\n\\Rightarrow\n\\Ext_\\mathcal{O}^{i + j}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{F}).\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0011": "$\\Hom_\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{homology-section-double-complex}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{example}\n\\label{example-hom-complex-into-sheaf}\n", "suffix": "\\end{example}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3d98a2b7b4d84662e4bb16f92250c5d1b527e86e9b174d86f0ad18203ae44bd7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:34da8a976eb265e5735b5cae28611f1db22983862100b6248d67b8ec633c4c6a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a bounded above complex of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an <MATH_0005>-module. Then there is a\nspectral sequence with <MATH_0006>-page\n<MATH_0007>\nand another spectral sequence with <MATH_0008>-page\n<MATH_0009>\nTo construct these spectral sequences choose an injective resolution\n<MATH_0010> and consider the two spectral\nsequences coming from the double complex\n<MATH_0011>, see\nHomology, Section <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:da15b142ba4bb56b0d900c68fed230dd649d30539e70dcbd76ff0132c4a6fa2b", "unit_id": "tag:07AA:statement"}
